            <template>Dashen Bank ATM Hardware - GRG XFS</template>
            <name>Dashen Bank ATM Hardware - GRG XFS</name>
            <description>Dashen Bank GRG ATM hardware monitoring via 32-bit CEN/XFS 3.0 API. Collects Cash Dispenser (CDM) operational status, safe door status, and per-cassette live currency counts and health.</description>
